WEBVTT

00:07:57.695 --> 00:08:00.442
nilijitayarisha kwa kila aina
ya majibu hasi,

00:08:00.466 --> 00:08:04.213
kuliko vote: 
sikutarajia kupata jibu lolote.

00:08:05.216 --> 00:08:07.963
Tokeo ambalo sikujiandaa tu

00:08:07.987 --> 00:08:10.216
ndilo nililopata-

00:08:10.240 --> 00:08:15.151
barua ya kukiri kutoka Tom, iliyojaa majuto.

00:08:15.618 --> 00:08:19.705
Yeye pia alikuwa amefungwa katika ukimya.

00:08:20.354 --> 00:08:24.404
Na huo ndio mwanzo wa mawasiliano ya yetu yaliyodumu miaka nane

00:08:24.428 --> 00:08:26.852
Mungu anajua haikuwa rahisi kamwe,

00:08:26.876 --> 00:08:29.044
lakini daima ukweli.

00:08:29.717 --> 00:08:33.304
Nilitua dhulma yote niliyobeba,